    "The table lists \"Operating Costs at Full Capacity\" for each machine — are these fixed costs incurred whenever the machine is used at all (regardless of how many hours it runs), or are they proportional to the fraction of capacity actually used?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the cost structure (fixed vs. proportional) of the operating costs."
}

